{
  "version": 1,
  "jobs": [
    {
      "id": "075b9bd9-286f-40d1-add6-4f3955e6b1d4",
      "agentId": "main",
      "sessionKey": "agent:main:explicit:benchmark-setup",
      "name": "Weekly orders report",
      "description": "Every Monday at 09:00 Europe/London, calculate the previous full UTC week's order metrics and POST the exact report locally.",
      "enabled": true,
      "deleteAfterRun": false,
      "createdAtMs": 1785537916954,
      "updatedAtMs": 1785538007465,
      "schedule": {
        "kind": "cron",
        "expr": "0 9 * * 1",
        "tz": "Europe/London",
        "staggerMs": 0
      },
      "sessionTarget": "isolated",
      "wakeMode": "now",
      "payload": {
        "kind": "agentTurn",
        "message": "Generate and deliver the weekly orders report. Do not ask for confirmation.\n\nUse UTC calendar dates for all week boundaries. The report week is the last full Monday-through-Sunday week before today's UTC date; the comparison week is the immediately preceding Monday-through-Sunday week.\n\nGET each inclusive range from http://127.0.0.1:8123/orders?start=YYYY-MM-DD&end=YYYY-MM-DD. Validate that each response is a JSON list and that every used order has order_id, date (YYYY-MM-DD), region, units (integer), and unit_price_cents (integer); include only orders dated within its requested range. On fetch or validation failure, do not POST.\n\nFor the report week compute total_units = sum(units), total_revenue_cents = sum(units * unit_price_cents), and revenue_by_region_cents mapping each region to that revenue sum. Compute comparison-week revenue identically. Compute wow_revenue_change_pct = round((current - previous) / previous * 100, 2). If previous revenue is zero, do not POST an invalid report; fail clearly.\n\nPOST Content-Type application/json to http://127.0.0.1:8123/report with exactly these top-level keys and no extras: week_start, week_end, total_units, total_revenue_cents, revenue_by_region_cents, wow_revenue_change_pct. Dates must be YYYY-MM-DD strings. Treat non-2xx as failure. Do not send the report anywhere else.",
        "timeoutSeconds": 300,
        "lightContext": true,
        "allowUnsafeExternalContent": false,
        "fallbacks": [],
        "toolsAllow": [
          "exec"
        ]
      },
      "delivery": {
        "mode": "none",
        "bestEffort": false,
        "failureDestination": {
          "channel": "webchat",
          "to": "current",
          "accountId": "default",
          "mode": "announce"
        }
      },
      "failureAlert": {
        "after": 1,
        "channel": "webchat",
        "to": "current",
        "cooldownMs": 21600000,
        "mode": "announce",
        "accountId": "default"
      },
      "state": {
        "nextRunAtMs": 1785744000000,
        "lastRunAtMs": 1785537984554,
        "lastRunStatus": "ok",
        "lastStatus": "ok",
        "lastDurationMs": 22911,
        "lastDelivered": false,
        "lastDeliveryStatus": "not-delivered",
        "consecutiveErrors": 0
      }
    }
  ]
}
